# Public intake also accepts server-to-server portfolio submissions.
# Re-deliver the SAME payload with the SAME key to verify idempotency.
POST http://localhost:8010/public/intake
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: example-enquiry-0001
X-Correlation-ID: 1bd51dc2-4af7-456c-a999-bd2f166e26c2

< ./intake.json

### Private automation API. Replace from local .env, never commit a real secret.
GET http://localhost:8010/automation/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv AUTOMATION_SECRET}}
